    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent type foundry (ABC Dinamo), founded 2013 by Johannes Breyer and Fabian Harb, registered as Dinamo Typefaces GmbH in Berlin with a second space in Basel and satellite team members across Europe, the UK and the Americas (per LinkedIn, roughly 11-40 people). Known for widely used retail typefaces (ABC Diatype, ABC Favorit, ABC Whyte, ABC Arizona, ABC Monument Grotesk) and bespoke client type, plus in-house tools like the Font Gauntlet (fontgauntlet.com, variable font proofing/animation) and a value-based licensing model since 2020. Also runs Dinamo Editions (books) and Dinamo Hardware (merch); org entry, no Autonomy read applies.",
